  "purpose": "S4-2a: solve B6 (heads-up 20bb with postflop) with the L1 leaf model in the same DCFR iterations as the trunk; measure the primary metric of decision P2D8 (in-sample and held-out) and the auxiliary metric, the effect of each change that reduces the boards' noise, the evaluator variants, the difference from L0, and the iteration and evaluation time on B6 and B7.",
