  "reproducibility": "verified",
  "reproducibility_note": "The recorded runs were executed once each with the listed binaries and commands. The final binary of 34d7811 reproduced the exploration run b6v4-n32-treg-a15-b1 bit for bit (results/check). The binary of 0c7c464 (the stack fix) gave B6 profiles and checkpoints bit-identical to 34d7811 over 300 iterations with and without the control variates. Runs are deterministic for a given seed and do not depend on the thread count; times depend on the machine and its load (results/load.log).",
